+## Get help with a request
+
+Open **Settings → Help → Support tickets** in the dashboard. Include the failing action and its request ID or error code if available. Keep credentials and private call content out of the message. [Open and follow a ticket](/guides/business/account#get-help).
+
 ## Check the outcome

 Use the task’s permissions and prerequisites before making changes. Read the saved result and keep an unavailable or uncertain result distinct from confirmed success. The linked guides explain the relevant recovery steps.
